        "description": "David Dastmalchian is a renaissance man: an actor, producer, talk show host, and writer of both films and comics. His career took off after being cast in a small-but-crucial role in Christopher Nolan's The Dark Knight and, from there, directors like Denis Villeneuve, David Lynch, and Mike Flanagan were lining up to include his one-of-a-kind energy in their projects. Now, he's starring in Street Fighter as M. Bison, one of gaming's most iconic villains. Dastmalchian sits down with IGN's Tom Jorgensen for a deep dive into the ups and downs of his one-of-a-kind career.",
